.git
.gitignore
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.venv
venv
.pytest_cache
docker-compose.yml
# tests/ and tools/ are NOT excluded: the `test` build stage copies tests, and
# excluding them here would fail the build with a confusing missing-path error.

# Development backups must never reach the image or the repo. They leak
# working history and read as sloppy packaging to anyone who opens a shell
# in the container.
**/*.bak
**/*.bak.*
**/*.bak*
